{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-32","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内角和与外角定理","englishTitle":"In any triangle, if one of the sides be produced, the exterior angle is equal to the two interior and opposite angles, and the three interior angles of the triangle are equal to two right angles.","book":1,"number":32,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":32,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","contentId":"euclid-1-32","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"201920af92743de109c904c5cd4d79fdffd964c809854ca3c92e8355685d1f02","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-32.statement","euclid-1-32.construction.1","euclid-1-32.proof.1","euclid-1-32.construction.2","euclid-1-32.proof.2","euclid-1-32.proof.3","euclid-1-32.proof.4","euclid-1-32.construction.3","euclid-1-32.proof.5","euclid-1-32.proof.6","euclid-1-32.conclusion","euclid-1-32.historical.1","euclid-1-32.historical.2","euclid-1-32.historical.3","euclid-1-32.historical.4","euclid-1-32.historical.5","euclid-1-32.historical.6","euclid-1-32.historical.7","euclid-1-32.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-32.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e48ccb0cd6513ebe44dea87e22a1dd2865113b790788effb26ed5e2e155e0b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle, if one of the sides be produced, the exterior angle is equal to the two interior and opposite angles, and the three interior angles of the triangle are equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,如果侧面延伸,外角等于两个内角和对角,三角形的三个内角等于两个直角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之外角与相对之内两角并等凡三角形之内三角并与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一个三角形的两个内角的和与两个对角的内角相等；每当三角形的内角等于两个直角时，"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39e8d35a8824892063718b2056e8670ccb26b9cce9892eb7e9c4649506ef38c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle, and let one side of it BC be produced to D;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC成为三角形,让其中的一方将BC扩大到D;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83b2b32941c338136b0490d10dac8202a135c2db35a612db055447131267d990","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the exterior angle ACD is equal to the two interior and opposite angles CAB, ABC, and the three interior angles of the triangle ABC, BCA, CAB are equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说外角ACD等于两个内角和对角CAB,ABC,三角形的3个内角ABC,BCA,CAB等于2,直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bae1dc1735f9cf6cd141c895f9818464ff38499e806436be3c195701e8f8e90","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let CE be drawn through the point C parallel to the straight line AB. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将CE划入与直线AB线平行的C点。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d5272659e08d431593326cc00cd8dfee94d563db1bb117f6e35b5495d342838","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is parallel to CE, and AC has fallen upon them, the alternate angles BAC, ACE are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB和CE平行,AC已经落到它们身上,内错角 BAC,ACE等同。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c88203012824c8be8620cc75e39c599469fd7f655a745da703436e24c47f9944","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AB is parallel to CE, and the straight line BD has fallen upon them, the exterior angle ECD is equal to the interior and opposite angle ABC. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AB线与CE线平行,BD直线已落在它们身上,ECD外部角相当于ABC不相邻的内角。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5acccacae2ca9c5635a581f950c6fe1d6450ce389fc5747799d6c526a63dafcf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ACE was also proved equal to the angle BAC; therefore the whole angle ACD is equal to the two interior and opposite angles BAC, ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ACE角也与BAC角相等;因此,整个ACD角等于两个内角和对角BAC、ABC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"417a3ba0fb1236abe6b2d3dee736e5eed3c3704006d6aef03e0db17f995a9ed0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle ACB be added to each; therefore the angles ACD, ACB are equal to the three angles ABC, BCA, CAB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将ACB角加到每个角;因此,ACD角和ACB角等于三个角ABC、BCA、CAB角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7094ff58626cdebe091d1f7c530b5a11d10ef50f1bc38b0f1c65a4c865f4d6f7","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles ACD, ACB are equal to two right angles; [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] therefore the angles ABC, BCA, CAB are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度ACD,ACB等于2,直角,因此角度ABC,BCA,CAB也等于2,直角。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"afaec898997f9fea78b0a5cc1e230a24c98d11695561125042680160c526f8fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之外角与相对之内两角并等凡三角形之内三角并与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一个三角形的两个内角的和与两个对角的内角相等；每当三角形的内角等于两个直角时，"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d76fa12abab529da1863f6085e548ee1be54a1ae2eccf500a6dad139f6bbfdb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙角形试从乙丙边引至丁题言甲丙丁外角与相对之内两角甲乙并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，按如下方式解释：P 三角形 0000，尝试从边 乙丙 画到 丁。命题解释：外角和两个内对角 甲乙 的和是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc8fc835744261bf92a385cac46c9c4b4255748a4668422ff0da630e37934f8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作戊丙线与甲乙平行〈本篇三一〉令甲丙为甲乙戊丙之交加线则乙甲丙角与相对之甲丙戊角等〈本篇卄九〉又乙丁线与两平行线相遇则戊丙丁外角与相对之甲乙丙内角等〈本篇廿九〉既甲丙戊与乙甲丙等而戊丙丁与甲乙丙又等则甲丙丁外角与内两角甲乙并等矣后解曰：甲乙丙三角并与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试作直线 戊丙 平行于 甲乙 〈本篇三一〉，设 甲丙 为 甲乙戊丙 的交点和加线，则 乙甲丙 的角与 甲丙戊 的对角等于 〈本篇卄九〉，且直线 乙丁 与两条平行线相交，则 戊丙丁 的外角与 甲乙丙 的对顶内角等于 〈本篇廿九〉。由于 甲丙戊 等于 乙甲丙 且 戊丙丁 等于 甲乙丙，则外角与内角之和 甲乙 等于 甲丙丁。其说明如下：甲乙丙 三角形且两直角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b85449e2244f581892674653a252352c345849f0525bee6a301569c384854162","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：既甲丙丁角与甲乙两角并等更于甲丙丁加甲丙乙则甲丙丁甲丙乙两角并与甲乙丙内三角并等矣〈公论二〉夫甲丙丁甲丙乙并元与两直角等〈本篇〉〈十三〉则甲乙丙内三角并亦与两直角等増从此推知凡第一形当两直角第二形当四直角第三形当六直角自此以上至于无穷每命形之数倍之为所当直角之数〈凡一线二线不能为形故三边〉〈为第一形四边为第二形五边为第三形六边为第四形仿此以至无穷〉又视每形边数减二边即所存边数是本形之数"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：因为外角甲丙丁等于三角形另外两个内角之和，再把角甲丙乙同时加到两边，就得到角甲丙丁与角甲丙乙之和，等于三角形甲乙丙三个内角之和〈公论二〉。而这两个相邻角之和等于两个直角〈本篇〉〈十三〉，所以三角形三个内角之和也等于两个直角。由此可推得：三角形内角和为两个直角，四边形为四个直角，五边形为六个直角，以后每增加一条边，内角和就增加两个直角。一般地，n 边形的内角和等于 2(n－2) 个直角。〈凡一线二线不能为形故三边〉〈为第一形四边为第二形五边为第三形六边为第四形仿此以至无穷〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27fabbd5816cbfbebaa577b3360d779a290128725abff17879d1390d7d22cfd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如上四图第一形三边减二边存一边即是本形一数倍之当两直角〈本题〉第二形四边减二边存二边即是本形二数倍之当四直角欲显此理试以第二形作一对角线成两三角形每形当两直角并之则当四直角矣第三形五边减二边存三边即是本形三数倍之当六直角欲显此理试以第三形作两对角线成三三角形每形当两直角并之亦当六直角矣其馀依此推显以至无穷"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如上四个图所示，第一种形式减去两边，保留一边，相当于原始形状的几倍，对应两个直角 〈本题〉。第二种形状，减去两边并保留两边等于原始形状的两倍，对应四个直角。为了证明这一原理，尝试从第二种形式画一条对角线形成两个三角形。每个形状对应两个直角，因此它对应四个直角。对于第三种形式，减去两边并保留三边是原始形状的三倍，对应六个直角。为了证明这一原理，尝试从第三种形式画两条对角线形成三个三角形。每个形状对应两个直角，结合起来也对应六个直角。其余部分可以由此推断至无穷。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"afb799ba60625ac7ac558472fd6b55bf4c0b2b1f0f114c1f58226156ee1fc534","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"又一法每形视其边数每边当两直角而减四直角其存者即本形所当直角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"另一种方法：对于每个形状，考虑边的数量；每条边应对应两个直角，然后减去四个直角；剩下的边就是对应原始形状的直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.historical.7","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8a62466e5d9270079a087c9046bfeb7c415371881f34346997dab270c926fba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：欲显此理试于形中任作一点从此点向各角俱作直线令每形所分角形之数如其边数每一分形三角当二直角〈本题〉其近点之处不论几角皆当四直角〈本篇十五之系〉次减近点诸角即是减四直角其存者则本形所当直角如上第四形六边中间任指一点从点向各角分为六三角形每一分形三角六形共十八角今于近点处减当四直角之六角所存近边十二角当八直角馀仿此一系凡诸种角形之三角并俱相等〈本题増〉二系凡两腰等角形若腰间直角则馀两角每当直角之半腰间钝角则馀两角俱小于半直角腰间锐角则馀两角俱大于半直角三系平边角形每角当直角三分之二四系平边角形若从一角向对边作垂线分为两角形此分形各有一直角在垂线之下两旁则垂线之上两旁角每当直角三分之一其馀两角每当直角三分之二増从三系可分一直角为三平分其法任于一边立平边角形次分对直角一边为两平分从此边对角作垂线即所求如上图甲乙丙直角求三分之先于甲乙线上作甲乙丁平边角形〈本篇一〉次平分甲丁于戊〈本篇九〉末作乙戊直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：为了说明这一原理，试着在图形中画任意一点，并从此点向每个角画直线，使每个图形划分的三角形数量对应边的数量。每个分形三角形对应两个直角 〈本题〉。不管该点附近的角数量多少，每个角对应四个直角 〈本篇十五之系〉。减去该点附近的角，相当于减去四个直角。剩下的直角对应原始图形，如上所示。在第四种形式中，六边形的中间任意一点，从该点到每个角，将六个三角形划分为六个三角形。每个分形三角形共有十八个角。现在，减去在近点对应的四个直角的六边形；十二个近侧角对应八个直角。在此系统中，各种类型的所有三角形都是相等的 〈本题増〉。对于直角边相等的三角形，如果边是直角，剩余的两个角等于边的一半；对于每个半边的钝角，剩余的两个角小于其他两个角的一半。对于两边之间有锐角的直角，另外两个角都大于直角的一半。对于三系等边三角形，每个角对应直角的三分之二。对于四系等边三角形，如果从一个角向对边画垂线，将其分成两个三角形。每个分形在两侧都有直角，在垂线下方的两侧，垂线上的两个角等于直角的三分之一，另两个角等于直角的三分之二。从这三个系统来看，直角可以被分为三个平分。方法是在一侧设置一个等边三角形，然后将直角平分。从这一侧，画一条垂线穿过对角。如上图所示，甲乙丙 对于直角，先在 甲乙 线画一个等边三角形。在 〈本篇一〉 线上画一个等边三角形；将 平分到下一级；在 戊〈本篇九〉 的末端画 乙戊 线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-32.source","contentId":"euclid-1-32","revisionId":"euclid-1-32@raw-201920af92743de1","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e92f64bcf49a17a0fa46cb4861365f3401525816a3ba5878f9493d1ad1fac1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-32:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-32.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-32:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-32.proof.2","euclid-1-32.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-32:euclid-1-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-32.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 13"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-9:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-9.proof.3","euclid-2-9.proof.6","euclid-2-9.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-10:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-10","sourceBlock